    <tags>teraterm terminal ssh telnet serial admin</tags>
    <summary>Tera Term is free software terminal emulator supporting ssh, telnet and serial connection.</summary>
    <description>
Tera Term is free software terminal emulator which supports:

 * TCP/IP (telnet, ssh, raw), serial, and named-pipe connections.
 * VT100 emulation and selected VT200/300/400/500 emulation.
 * Tek4010 emulation.
 * File transfer protocols (Kermit, XMODEM, YMODEM, ZMODEM, B-PLUS, and Quick-VAN)
 * Scripts using the "Tera Term Language".
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>
## Tera Term
### 2025.11.17 (Ver 5.5.1)
  * Bug fixes
    * Fixed settings not updating to match the log file name after user modification in the "Log" dialog box (to input the log file name). (issue #896)
    * Fixed an issue where a comment could not be added (File > Comment to Log...) while binary logging. (issue #863)
    * Fixed Tera Term crashes when selecting multiple files using Kermit or Quick-VAN or YMODEM or ZMODEM send. (issue #9, #942)
    * Fixed CANCEL is not implemented when YMODEM receiving. (issue #786)
    * Fixed ZMODEM receiving stop when file writing was impossible. (issue #917)
    * Modified the CR LF sent in the ZMODEM hex header from 0x8D 0x8A to 0x0D 0x8A. (issue #889)
    * Fixed Print (File > Print...) is not Unicode compatible. (issue #815)
  * Misc
    * Upgraded TTSSH to 3.5.1.

## TTSSH
### 2025.11.17 (Ver 3.5.1)
  * Bug fixes
    * Fixed disconnection after key re-exchange. This bug was introduced in 3.5.0 (Tera Term 5.5.0). (issue #895)
    * Fixed an issue where SCP file transfer became slow. This bug was introduced in 3.4.1 (Tera Term 5.4.1). (issue #883)
    </releaseNotes>
